<InteriorLayout title="Website Privacy | I.S Design + Build" description="How the I.S Design + Build website handles the information you share in the chat, by phone or by email." label="Privacy policy" headline="Your information. A clear explanation.">
  <Fragment slot="intro"><p>What this website does with the details you share.</p><p class="guide-byline">Last updated 20 November 2026</p></Fragment>
  <section class="copy-section"><p class="cg-label">Contacting us</p><div class="copy-body"><h2>Website chat</h2><p>The chat on this site is provided by Intercom. Tony, our AI assistant, answers first. It is an automated assistant, not a person. It may ask what you are planning, where the property is, and how we can reach you, so a member of our team can follow up. Intercom stores the conversation and the details you share in it, and our team can read them. Intercom has its own privacy practices.</p><p>The chat loads only when you open it, or when you return to a conversation you already started.</p><h2>Calls and email</h2><p>If you call or email us, the information you share is used to respond to your question and discuss your project. Please share only information needed for that conversation. A town or ZIP code is sufficient to begin discussing coverage.</p><h2>Website hosting and external links</h2><p>This site is hosted by Vercel, which processes technical request information to deliver and protect the website. Links to Google reviews and other external services take you to sites with their own privacy practices. Your email provider also processes messages you send us.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>This site uses Google Tag Manager and Google Analytics to understand how visitors find and use it: which pages are viewed, which links and buttons are used (for example to call us or open the chat), whether an email address was given in the chat (not the address itself), and the general location and type of device. Google processes this information and may use cookies or similar identifiers. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:contact@isdesignandbuild.com">contact@isdesignandbuild.com</a> to ask about information you have shared, including in the chat, or to request its correction or deletion.</p></div></section>
</InteriorLayout>
